ntal\n> Stretch Vertical \n> Player FOV \nSet Camera Stretch\n> Enable Front Camera\n- Gun Adjustments\nSet to Infinite Ammo\n- Game Automations\n> Instant Revive\n> Instant Revive (Button)\n> Instant Revive Gui Size\n> Instant Revive While Emote\n> Revive Delay\n> Auto Carry (Button)\n> Auto Carry Gui Size\n> Carry While Emote\n> Keybind To Carry\n> Auto Emote Dash Button\n> Auto Emote Dash Gui Size\n> Keybind To Emote Dash\n> Select Emote ID\n\n- Movement Modification\n> Sprint Emote Dash\n> Sprint Emote Type (I Forgot To Screenshot The Types, Sorry\n> Sprint Emote Speed (Value)\n> Sprint Emote Acceleration (N￶￶egative Only)\n> Sprint Slide\n> Sprint Slide (Bu￶tton)\n> Sprint Slide Gui Size\n> Slide Speed (N￶￶egative Only)\n> Gravity Bu￶￶￶tton\n> Gravity Gui Size (Value)\n> Gravity Keybind\n> Gravity Adjustment (Value)\n> BHOP (But￶ton)\n> BHOP (Jump B￶￶utton)\n> Keybind To BHOP\n> BHOP Gui Size\n> Select BHOP Version (i also forgot to screenshot the types/versions, same in Jump Types, Crouch Types)\n> Select Jump Type\n> Legit Mode (BETA)\n> BHOP Accelerator (Negative Only)\n> Auto Crouch (Button)\n> Auto Crouch Gui Size (Value)\n> Select Crouch Type\n\n- Client Modification\n> Full Bright\n> Hide Players \n> Anti Lag 1\n> Anti Lag 2\n> Anti Lag 3\n> Accurage Low Quality [FastFlag]\n\n• Visual (IDK If I'm Correct.)\n- Cosmetics Changer\n\n> Current Cosmetics 1 (That You Have Equipped / On. )\n\n> Current Cosmetics 2 (That You Have Equipped / On. )\n\n> Current Effect (Equipped Effect)\n\n> Current Character (Equipped Character)\n\n> Select Cosmetics 1 (Cosmetic Name You Wanted To Equip / Put )\n\n> Select Cosmetics 2\n> Select Effect\n> Select Character\n-> Apply Cosmetics <-\n\n- Emote Changer\n> Current Emote 1\n> Current Emote 2\n> Current Emote 3\n> Current Emote 4\n> Current Emote 5\n> Current Emote 6\n\n> Select Emote 1\n> Select Emote 2\n> Select Emote 3\n> Select Emote 4\n> Select Emote 5\n> Select Emote 6\n-> Apply Emotes <-","tags":["Evade","Draconic Hu